[Player:Robbie the robot]
Robbie is drawn in #N$47 (white, bright) while he is empty-handed. When he
picks up a spray can, he and the can he carries take on the colour of that
can: cyan, yellow or red.

#TABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre) { =h Frame 1 | =h Frame 2 | =h Frame 3 | =h Frame 4 }
{
  #SPRITE$778A,attr=$47(robbie-01-colour*) |
  #SPRITE$77C6,attr=$47(robbie-02-colour*) |
  #SPRITE$7802,attr=$47(robbie-03-colour*) |
  #SPRITE$783E,attr=$47(robbie-04-colour*)
}
TABLE#

#FRAMES(robbie-01-colour,50;robbie-02-colour;robbie-03-colour;robbie-04-colour)(robbie-colour)

#TABLE(default,centre,centre,centre) { =h Cyan Can | =h Yellow Can | =h Red Can }
{ #SPRITE$778A,attr=$45(robbie-can-cyan) | #SPRITE$778A,attr=$46(robbie-can-yellow) | #SPRITE$778A,attr=$42(robbie-can-red) }
TABLE#

[Weapons:Insect Repellent/ Super Space Slug Spray]
The spray is drawn in #N$45 (cyan, bright).

#TABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre) { =h Frame 1 | =h Frame 2 | =h Frame 3 | =h Frame 4 }
{
  #SPRITE$7BF1,attr=$45(repellent-01-cyan) |
  #SPRITE$7C02,attr=$45(repellent-02-cyan) |
  #SPRITE$7C15,attr=$45(repellent-03-cyan) |
  #SPRITE$7C26,attr=$45(repellent-04-cyan)
}
TABLE#

[Weapons:Streamer/ Leech Laser]
The colour of the streamer is picked at random from #N$47 (white), #N$46
(yellow), #N$45 (cyan) and #N$43 (magenta), all bright. White is shown here.

#TABLE(default,centre,centre) { =h Frame 1 | =h Frame 2 }
{
  #SPRITE$7991,attr=$47(streamer-01-white) |
  #SPRITE$79A2,attr=$47(streamer-02-white)
}
TABLE#

