[Items:Spray Cans]
The cubby-holes either side of the play area hold a cyan, a yellow and a red
spray can. The frames below are the can Robbie carries above his head.

#TABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre) { =h Frame 1 | =h Frame 2 | =h Frame 3 | =h Frame 4 }
{
  #SPRITE$76EE,attr=$45(can-01-cyan) |
  #SPRITE$7711,attr=$45(can-02-cyan) |
  #SPRITE$7734,attr=$45(can-03-cyan) |
  #SPRITE$7757,attr=$45(can-04-cyan)
}
{
  #SPRITE$76EE,attr=$46(can-01-yellow) |
  #SPRITE$7711,attr=$46(can-02-yellow) |
  #SPRITE$7734,attr=$46(can-03-yellow) |
  #SPRITE$7757,attr=$46(can-04-yellow)
}
{
  #SPRITE$76EE,attr=$42(can-01-red) |
  #SPRITE$7711,attr=$42(can-02-red) |
  #SPRITE$7734,attr=$42(can-03-red) |
  #SPRITE$7757,attr=$42(can-04-red)
}
